{"unit_id": "tag:06T4:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是预形变范畴（predeformation category）。我们称泛形式对象（versal formal object）<MATH_0002>，它属于<MATH_0003>，为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>极小的（minimal）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001><FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>这可能是非标准的术语。许多作者将此概念与切空间（tangent spaces）的性质联系起来。我们将在第<REF_0001>节建立这种联系。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>，如果对形式对象（formal objects）的任意态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>，其底层的环（rings）上的映射（map）都是满射的（surjective）。有时，极小泛形式对象（minimal versal formal object）被称为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>极小泛的（miniversal）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "predeformation category", "target_term": "预形变范畴"}, {"source_term": "versal formal object", "target_term": "泛形式对象"}, {"source_term": "minimal", "target_term": "极小的"}, {"source_term": "tangent spaces", "target_term": "切空间"}, {"source_term": "formal objects", "target_term": "形式对象"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射的"}, {"source_term": "minimal versal formal object", "target_term": "极小泛形式对象"}, {"source_term": "miniversal", "target_term": "极小泛的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "predeformation category", "target_term": "预形变范畴", "context": "所给范畴，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "versal formal object", "target_term": "泛形式对象", "context": "所给形式对象，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "minimal", "target_term": "极小的", "context": "所定义极小性，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "tangent spaces", "target_term": "切空间", "context": "脚注所述空间，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "formal objects", "target_term": "形式对象", "context": "所给对象，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "对象间态射，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环", "context": "底层环，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "底层映射，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射的", "context": "映射性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "minimal versal formal object", "target_term": "极小泛形式对象", "context": "所定义对象，译法待决"}, {"so