{"unit_id": "tag:06T0:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节的工作表明此定义是合理的。首先，泛形式对象（versal formal object）的存在蕴涵<MATH_0001>满足 (S1)。随后，前述引理表明存在极小泛形式对象（minimal versal formal object）。最后，任意两个极小泛形式对象（minimal versal formal objects）都是同构的（isomorphic）。以下汇总我们的结论（附详细证明）。\n\n", "allowed_english": ["S"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "versal formal object", "target_term": "泛形式对象"}, {"source_term": "minimal versal formal object", "target_term": "极小泛形式对象"}, {"source_term": "minimal versal formal objects", "target_term": "极小泛形式对象"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "versal formal object", "target_term": "泛形式对象", "context": "所给对象，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "minimal versal formal object", "target_term": "极小泛形式对象", "context": "所给对象，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "minimal versal formal objects", "target_term": "极小泛形式对象", "context": "所比较对象，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构的", "context": "对象间关系，译法待决"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:06T5:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是具有泛形式对象（versal formal object）的预形变范畴（predeformation category）。则\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0002>具有极小泛形式对象（minimal versal formal object），\n<STRUCT_0003> 极小的（minimal）泛对象（versal objects）在同构（isomorphism）意义下唯一，并且\n<STRUCT_0004> 任意泛对象（versal object）都是某个极小泛对象（minimal versal object）沿幂级数环（power series ring）扩张（extension）的推前（pushforward）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "versal formal object", "target_term": "泛形式对象"}, {"source_term": "predeformation category", "target_term": "预形变范畴"}, {"source_term": "minimal versal formal object", "target_term": "极小泛形式对象"}, {"source_term": "minimal", "target_term": "极小的"}, {"source_term": "versal objects", "target_term": "泛对象"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "versal object", "target_term": "泛对象"}, {"source_term": "minimal versal object", "target_term": "极小泛对象"}, {"source_term": "power series ring", "target_term": "幂级数环"}, {"source_term": "extension", "target_term": "扩张"}, {"source_term": "pushforward", "target_term": "推前"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "versal formal object", "target_term": "泛形式对象", "context": "所给对象，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "predeformation category", "target_term": "预形变范畴", "context": "所给范畴，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "minimal versal formal object", "target_term": "极小泛形式对象", "context": "所断言对象，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "minimal", "target_term": "极小的", "context": "对象性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "versal objects", "target_term": "泛对象", "context": "所给对象，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "唯一性所取关系，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "versal object", "target_term": "泛对象", "context": "所给对象，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "minimal versal object", "target_term": "极小泛对象", "context": "所给对象，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "power series ring", "target_term": "幂级数环", "context": "底层环扩张，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "extension", "target_term": "扩张", "context": "所给环扩张，译法待决"}, {"source_term"