{"unit_id": "tag:06T5:proof", "translation": "假设<MATH_0001>具有泛形式对象（versal formal object）<MATH_0002>，位于<MATH_0003>之上。则它满足 (S1)，见引理<REF_0001>。令<MATH_0004>，位于<MATH_0005>之上，是引理<REF_0002>中构造的任意一个态射（morphisms）。由引理<REF_0003>可知<MATH_0006>是泛的（versal），因而它是极小泛形式对象（minimal versal formal object）（由构造）。这证明了 (1)。又有<MATH_0007>，这证明了 (3)。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n假设<MATH_0008>是两个极小泛形式对象（minimal versal formal objects）。由引理<REF_0004>，存在态射（morphisms）<MATH_0009>和<MATH_0010>。相应的环映射（ring maps）<MATH_0011>和<MATH_0012>由极小性（minimality）是满射的（surjective）。因此复合（compositions）<MATH_0013>和<MATH_0014>由代数（Algebra）一章的引理<REF_0005>是同构（isomorphisms）。故<MATH_0015>和<MATH_0016>是同构（isomorphisms），从而映射（maps）<MATH_0017>和<MATH_0018>是同构（isomorphisms）（因为<MATH_0019>在群胚（groupoids）上余纤维化（cofibred），见引理<REF_0006>）。这证明了 (2)，并完成引理的证明。\n", "allowed_english": ["S"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "versal formal object", "target_term": "泛形式对象"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "versal", "target_term": "泛的"}, {"source_term": "minimal versal formal object", "target_term": "极小泛形式对象"}, {"source_term": "minimal versal formal objects", "target_term": "极小泛形式对象"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "ring maps", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "minimality", "target_term": "极小性"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射的"}, {"source_term": "compositions", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "groupoids", "target_term": "群胚"}, {"source_term": "cofibred", "target_term": "余纤维化"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "versal formal object", "target_term": "泛形式对象", "context": "所给对象，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "所构造态射，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "versal", "target_ter